---
import MainGridLayout from "@/layouts/MainGridLayout.astro";

interface Props {
	lang?: string;
}

const { lang = Astro.url.pathname.startsWith("/en") ? "en" : "zh_CN" } =
	Astro.props;
const isEn = lang === "en";

const title = isEn
	? "Lightbearer Lab · The Optogenetics Lab"
	: "光控大脑 · 光遗传学与光控神经元实验室";
const description = isEn
	? "The Optogenetics Lab: Celebrating Karl Deisseroth, Peter Hegemann, and Georg Nagel's 2026 Nobel Prize in Physiology or Medicine. Interactive light-gated ion channels, millisecond neuron switches, spike raster plots, and Chlamydomonas phototaxis."
	: "光控大脑 · LIGHTBEARER LAB：致敬戴瑟罗斯、黑格曼与纳格尔荣获 2026 诺贝尔生理学或医学奖。交互式 2D 光遗传学实验室——拖动 ~470nm 蓝光光斑点亮表达了视紫红质的神经元，观测毫秒级动作电位放电、实时光栅图、衣藻趋光与 2021 复明试验。";
---

<MainGridLayout title={title} description={description} lang={lang}>
	<div class="flex w-full rounded-(--radius-large) overflow-hidden relative min-h-32 mb-8">
		<div class="z-10 px-4 sm:px-8 py-8 relative w-full rounded-(--radius-large) overflow-hidden bg-[#050b14] text-zinc-100 border border-zinc-800/80 shadow-2xl selection:bg-blue-500/30 selection:text-blue-200">
			<!-- Background Ambient Glow & Grid -->
			<div class="absolute inset-0 pointer-events-none opacity-20 bg-[radial-gradient(#38bdf8_1px,transparent_1px)] [background-size:24px_24px] overflow-hidden"></div>
			<div class="absolute -top-32 -left-32 w-80 h-80 bg-blue-600/10 rounded-full blur-3xl pointer-events-none"></div>
			<div class="absolute top-1/3 -right-32 w-80 h-80 bg-amber-600/10 rounded-full blur-3xl pointer-events-none"></div>

			<!-- HERO HEADER SECTION -->
			<section class="relative z-10 mb-8 pb-8 border-b border-zinc-800/80">
				<div class="flex flex-wrap items-center justify-between gap-3 mb-4">
					<div class="flex flex-wrap items-center gap-2">
						<div class="inline-flex items-center gap-2 px-3 py-1 rounded-full bg-amber-500/10 border border-amber-500/30 text-amber-400 text-xs font-mono font-semibold tracking-wide">
							<span class="w-2 h-2 rounded-full bg-amber-400 animate-pulse"></span>
							<span class="lang-zh">★ 2026 诺贝尔生理学或医学奖 · DEISSEROTH, HEGEMANN, NAGEL</span>
							<span class="lang-en">★ 2026 NOBEL PRIZE IN MEDICINE · DEISSEROTH, HEGEMANN, NAGEL</span>
						</div>
						<div class="inline-flex items-center gap-1.5 px-3 py-1 rounded-full bg-blue-500/10 border border-blue-500/30 text-blue-400 text-xs font-mono">
							<span>⚡</span>
							<span>OPTOGENETICS · ChR2 (470nm)</span>
						</div>
					</div>
					<div class="text-xs font-mono text-zinc-400">
						<span class="lang-zh">2026-10-05 斯德哥尔摩卡罗林斯卡学院宣布</span>
						<span class="lang-en">Announced 2026-10-05 at Karolinska Institutet</span>
					</div>
				</div>

				<h1 class="text-3xl sm:text-5xl font-black tracking-tight text-white mb-2">
					<span class="lang-zh">光控大脑 · LIGHTBEARER LAB</span>
					<span class="lang-en">Lightbearer Lab · The Optogenetics Lab</span>
				</h1>
				<p class="text-lg sm:text-xl font-bold text-blue-400 mb-4 tracking-wide font-mono">
					<span class="lang-zh">The Optogenetics Lab — 用光开关神经元</span>
					<span class="lang-en">The Optogenetics Lab — Switching Neurons with Light</span>
				</p>
				<p class="text-sm sm:text-base text-zinc-300/90 max-w-3xl leading-relaxed mb-3">
					<span class="lang-zh">
						2026 年 10 月 5 日，瑞典卡罗林斯卡学院诺贝尔大会宣布将 2026 年诺贝尔生理学或医学奖授予卡尔·戴瑟罗斯（Karl Deisseroth，54 岁，美国斯坦福大学）、彼得·黑格曼（Peter Hegemann，71 岁，德国柏林洪堡大学）与格奥尔格·纳格尔（Georg Nagel，73 岁，德国维尔茨堡大学），表彰他们“发现光门控离子通道并开创光遗传学”（"for their discoveries concerning light-gated ion channels and optogenetics"），奖金 1,200 万瑞典克朗由三人均分。
					</span>
					<span class="lang-en">
						On October 5, 2026, the Nobel Assembly at Karolinska Institutet in Stockholm awarded the 2026 Nobel Prize in Physiology or Medicine to Karl Deisseroth (54, Stanford University, California), Peter Hegemann (71, Humboldt University, Berlin), and Georg Nagel (73, University of Würzburg, Germany) "for their discoveries concerning light-gated ion channels and optogenetics". The 12 million SEK (~$1.2M) prize is shared equally.
					</span>
				</p>
				<p class="text-xs sm:text-sm text-zinc-400 max-w-3xl leading-relaxed">
					<span class="lang-zh">
						源起微观绿藻：黑格曼与纳格尔破译了单细胞绿藻（衣藻）依靠眼点趋光的秘密，发现了通道视紫红质-2（ChR2）——吸收约 470 nm 蓝光瞬间敞开离子通道引发电信号；随后戴瑟罗斯将该基因转入哺乳动物活体大脑神经元，创造了以毫秒级精度随意开关神经元放电的“光遗传学”钥匙。本页面与《幽灵捕手》（中微子物理学）和《手性雪崩》（不对称化学）共同构成 2026 诺奖科学三部曲。
					</span>
					<span class="lang-en">
						From algae to mind: Hegemann and Nagel discovered channelrhodopsin-2 (ChR2) in green alga Chlamydomonas, a 7-transmembrane protein that opens a cation pore upon 470 nm blue light absorption. Deisseroth then expressed it in mammalian neurons, creating a millisecond-precision optical switch in living brain circuits. This completes the 2026 Nobel Science Trilogy alongside Ghost Catcher (Physics) and Chiral Cascade (Chemistry).
					</span>
				</p>
			</section>

			<!-- REAL-TIME STATS BANNER -->
			<section class="relative z-10 mb-8">
				<div class="rounded-2xl bg-zinc-950/90 border border-blue-500/30 p-5 sm:p-6 shadow-[0_0_25px_rgba(56,189,248,0.15)] relative overflow-hidden">
					<div class="absolute -right-16 -top-16 w-48 h-48 bg-blue-500/10 rounded-full blur-2xl pointer-events-none"></div>

					<div class="flex flex-wrap items-center justify-between gap-3 mb-3">
						<div class="flex items-center gap-2">
							<span id="stat-ping-dot" class="w-2.5 h-2.5 rounded-full bg-blue-400 animate-ping"></span>
							<span class="text-xs font-mono uppercase tracking-widest text-blue-300 font-bold">
								<span class="lang-zh">⚡ 光遗传学神经回路电生理实时监测</span>
								<span class="lang-en">⚡ Real-Time Optogenetic Electrophysiology Monitor</span>
							</span>
						</div>
						<div class="text-[11px] font-mono text-blue-400/90 bg-blue-950/60 px-2.5 py-1 rounded-md border border-blue-800/60 flex items-center gap-1.5">
							<span id="stat-beam-mode">470nm BLUE ACTIVE</span>
							<span>·</span>
							<span id="stat-strobe-state" class="text-zinc-400">10 Hz STROBE</span>
						</div>
					</div>

					<div class="flex flex-col md:flex-row items-baseline md:items-center justify-between gap-4">
						<div>
							<div class="text-xs font-mono text-zinc-400 mb-1">
								<span class="lang-zh">动作电位放电总数 (Spikes Fired):</span>
								<span class="lang-en">Total Action Potentials (Spikes Fired):</span>
							</div>
							<div class="flex items-baseline gap-3">
								<div id="stat-spikes-count" class="font-mono text-3xl sm:text-5xl font-black text-amber-300 tracking-wider drop-shadow-[0_0_15px_rgba(245,158,11,0.6)]">
									0
								</div>
								<div id="stat-latency-badge" class="text-xs font-mono font-bold px-2.5 py-1 rounded bg-blue-950 text-blue-300 border border-blue-800/60">
									Δt ≈ 2.1 ms (光脉冲 → 放电)
								</div>
							</div>
						</div>

						<div class="flex flex-col sm:flex-row gap-4 sm:gap-6 text-xs font-mono border-t md:border-t-0 md:border-l border-zinc-800 md:pl-6 pt-3 md:pt-0">
							<div>
								<span class="text-zinc-500 block">
									<span class="lang-zh">已激发光脉冲</span>
									<span class="lang-en">Light Pulses</span>
								</span>
								<div class="flex items-center gap-1.5 mt-0.5">
									<span id="stat-pulses-count" class="text-blue-400 font-bold">0</span>
									<span class="text-zinc-600">pulses</span>
								</div>
							</div>
							<div>
								<span class="text-zinc-500 block">
									<span class="lang-zh">瞬时放电频率</span>
									<span class="lang-en">Firing Frequency</span>
								</span>
								<span id="stat-freq-readout" class="text-amber-400 font-bold">10.0 Hz</span>
							</div>
							<div>
								<span class="text-zinc-500 block">
									<span class="lang-zh">光敏神经元覆盖</span>
									<span class="lang-en">Illuminated Neurons</span>
								</span>
								<span id="stat-active-ratio" class="text-blue-300 font-bold">0 / 64 (0%)</span>
							</div>
						</div>
					</div>

					<!-- Visual balance ratio bar -->
					<div class="mt-4 pt-3 border-t border-zinc-800/60">
						<div class="flex justify-between text-[11px] font-mono text-zinc-400 mb-1">
							<span class="text-blue-400 font-semibold">
								<span class="lang-zh">光照激活神经元比例</span>
								<span class="lang-en">Illuminated Neurons</span>
								<span id="bar-active-pct">0.0%</span>
							</span>
							<span class="text-zinc-500">ChR2-Expressing Population (N = 64)</span>
							<span class="text-amber-400 font-semibold">
								<span class="lang-zh">毫秒级同步放电锁定</span>
								<span class="lang-en">Phase-Locked Firing</span>
								<span id="bar-sync-pct">100%</span>
							</span>
						</div>
						<div class="w-full h-2 rounded-full bg-zinc-900 overflow-hidden flex">
							<div id="bar-fill-active" class="h-full bg-blue-400 transition-all duration-300 shadow-[0_0_8px_rgba(56,189,248,0.8)]" style="width: 25%;"></div>
							<div id="bar-fill-quiescent" class="h-full bg-zinc-800 transition-all duration-300" style="width: 75%;"></div>
						</div>
					</div>
				</div>
			</section>

			<!-- SECTION 1 & 3: THE SWITCH HERO LAB & PRESETS -->
			<section class="relative z-10 mb-10 pb-8 border-b border-zinc-800/80">
				<div class="flex flex-wrap items-center justify-between gap-3 mb-4">
					<div>
						<h2 class="text-2xl sm:text-3xl font-bold text-white tracking-tight flex items-center gap-2">
							<span class="text-blue-400 font-mono text-xl">01/</span>
							<span class="lang-zh">神经开关实验室 · The Switch Hero Lab</span>
							<span class="lang-en">The Switch Hero Lab · Optogenetic Canvas</span>
						</h2>
						<p class="text-xs sm:text-sm text-zinc-400 mt-1">
							<span class="lang-zh">在画布上拖动 470 nm 蓝光光斑。凡进入光束覆盖的神经元，其膜表面通道视紫红质（ChR2）瞬间开放，Na⁺/Ca²⁺ 涌入引发动作电位，橙色电脉冲沿神经突触传导！</span>
							<span class="lang-en">Drag the 470 nm coherent blue light spot over the neural field. Channelrhodopsin-2 (ChR2) channels open instantly upon illumination, triggering millisecond action potentials along neurites!</span>
						</p>
					</div>

					<!-- Presets Bar (Section 3 Presets) -->
					<div class="flex flex-wrap items-center gap-1.5 text-xs font-mono">
						<span class="text-zinc-400 mr-1">
							<span class="lang-zh">探索预设:</span>
							<span class="lang-en">Presets:</span>
						</span>
						<button id="preset-switch" type="button" class="px-2.5 py-1 rounded-md bg-blue-950/80 border border-blue-400 text-blue-200 hover:text-white hover:bg-blue-900 transition active:scale-95 font-semibold" title="Default multi-neuron switch field">
							🎛️ 开关 The Switch
						</button>
						<button id="preset-eyespot" type="button" class="px-2.5 py-1 rounded-md bg-zinc-900 border border-zinc-700 hover:border-zinc-500 text-zinc-300 hover:text-white transition active:scale-95" title="Chlamydomonas eyespot phototaxis tribute">
							🔬 眼点 Eye-spot
						</button>
						<button id="preset-single" type="button" class="px-2.5 py-1 rounded-md bg-zinc-900 border border-amber-500/50 text-amber-300 hover:text-white transition active:scale-95" title="Single cell patch-clamp oscilloscope">
							⚡ 单细胞 Single Cell
						</button>
						<button id="preset-circuit" type="button" class="px-2.5 py-1 rounded-md bg-zinc-900 border border-emerald-500/50 text-emerald-300 hover:text-white transition active:scale-95" title="Cortical circuit with synaptic delay">
							🧠 脑回路 Circuit
						</button>
						<button id="preset-vision" type="button" class="px-2.5 py-1 rounded-md bg-zinc-900 border border-purple-500/50 text-purple-300 hover:text-white transition active:scale-95" title="2021 Retinitis pigmentosa vision restoration trial">
							👁️ 复明 Vision (2021)
						</button>
					</div>
				</div>

				<!-- SIMULATOR CANVAS CONTAINER -->
				<div class="relative w-full rounded-2xl bg-[#030814] border border-zinc-800 shadow-[0_0_40px_rgba(0,0,0,0.8)] overflow-hidden mb-6">
					<!-- Canvas Overlay Toast Alert -->
					<div id="neuro-toast" class="absolute top-4 left-1/2 -translate-x-1/2 z-20 pointer-events-none transition-all duration-300 opacity-0 -translate-y-2">
						<div class="px-4 py-2 rounded-xl bg-zinc-950/95 border border-blue-500/50 text-xs font-mono shadow-2xl flex items-center gap-2">
							<span id="toast-icon">⚡</span>
							<span id="toast-msg" class="text-zinc-200"></span>
						</div>
					</div>

					<!-- Canvas Legend (Top Right) -->
					<div class="absolute top-3 right-3 z-10 pointer-events-none hidden sm:flex items-center gap-3 px-3 py-1.5 rounded-lg bg-black/70 border border-zinc-800 text-[11px] font-mono text-zinc-400 backdrop-blur-xs">
						<div class="flex items-center gap-1.5">
							<span class="w-2.5 h-2.5 rounded-full bg-blue-400 shadow-[0_0_6px_rgba(56,189,248,0.8)]"></span>
							<span class="lang-zh">ChR2 蓝光敏感通道 (~470nm)</span>
							<span class="lang-en">ChR2 Blue Sensor (~470nm)</span>
						</div>
						<div class="flex items-center gap-1.5">
							<span class="w-2.5 h-2.5 rounded-full bg-amber-400 shadow-[0_0_6px_rgba(245,158,11,0.8)]"></span>
							<span class="lang-zh">动作电位放电 (+30mV)</span>
							<span class="lang-en">Action Potential (+30mV)</span>
						</div>
						<div class="flex items-center gap-1.5">
							<span class="w-2 h-2 rounded-full bg-cyan-300 animate-ping"></span>
							<span class="lang-zh">毫秒级同步锁定</span>
							<span class="lang-en">ms Phase Lock</span>
						</div>
					</div>

					<!-- MAIN SIMULATION CANVAS -->
					<canvas
						id="neuro-canvas"
						class="w-full h-[460px] sm:h-[520px] block cursor-crosshair touch-none select-none"
					></canvas>
				</div>

				<!-- INTERACTIVE CONTROLS DOCK -->
				<div class="grid grid-cols-1 lg:grid-cols-12 gap-5 items-start">
					<!-- PRIMARY CONTROLS (Left Col: 7 cols) -->
					<div class="lg:col-span-7 space-y-4">
						<!-- FREQUENCY & PULSE SLIDER CARD -->
						<div class="p-4 sm:p-5 rounded-xl bg-zinc-950/80 border border-zinc-800/90 shadow-sm">
							<div class="flex flex-wrap items-center justify-between gap-2 mb-2">
								<div class="flex items-center gap-2">
									<span class="text-xs font-bold font-mono uppercase tracking-wider text-zinc-300">
										<span class="lang-zh">脉冲激发频率 (Pulse Frequency)</span>
										<span class="lang-en">Pulse Frequency (Hz)</span>
									</span>
									<span id="slider-freq-badge" class="text-xs font-mono font-bold px-2 py-0.5 rounded bg-blue-950 text-blue-300 border border-blue-800/60">
										10 Hz
									</span>
								</div>
								<div id="freq-status-badge" class="text-[11px] font-mono font-semibold px-2 py-0.5 rounded bg-zinc-900 border border-zinc-700 text-zinc-300">
									⚡ 经典生理频率 (θ/α 脑电波段)
								</div>
							</div>

							<input
								id="slider-frequency"
								type="range"
								min="1"
								max="40"
								step="1"
								value="10"
								class="w-full h-2 bg-zinc-800 rounded-lg appearance-none cursor-pointer accent-blue-400 focus:outline-hidden"
							/>

							<div class="flex justify-between text-[11px] font-mono text-zinc-500 mt-1">
								<span>1 Hz (单发节拍)</span>
								<span>10 Hz (经典频闪)</span>
								<span>20 Hz (β 驱动)</span>
								<span>40 Hz (γ 振荡上限)</span>
							</div>

							<!-- PULSE WIDTH & BEAM RADIUS ROW -->
							<div class="grid grid-cols-1 sm:grid-cols-2 gap-4 mt-4 pt-3 border-t border-zinc-800/70">
								<div>
									<div class="flex justify-between text-xs font-mono text-zinc-400 mb-1">
										<span>
											<span class="lang-zh">光脉冲宽度 (Width):</span>
											<span class="lang-en">Pulse Width:</span>
										</span>
										<span id="slider-width-badge" class="text-blue-300 font-bold">20 ms</span>
									</div>
									<input
										id="slider-width"
										type="range"
										min="5"
										max="50"
										step="1"
										value="20"
										class="w-full h-1.5 bg-zinc-800 rounded-lg appearance-none cursor-pointer accent-blue-400"
									/>
								</div>
								<div>
									<div class="flex justify-between text-xs font-mono text-zinc-400 mb-1">
										<span>
											<span class="lang-zh">蓝光光斑半径 (Radius):</span>
											<span class="lang-en">Beam Radius:</span>
										</span>
										<span id="slider-radius-badge" class="text-blue-300 font-bold">95 px</span>
									</div>
									<input
										id="slider-radius"
										type="range"
										min="40"
										max="160"
										step="5"
										value="95"
										class="w-full h-1.5 bg-zinc-800 rounded-lg appearance-none cursor-pointer accent-blue-400"
									/>
								</div>
							</div>
						</div>

						<!-- ACTION BUTTONS ROW -->
						<div class="grid grid-cols-1 sm:grid-cols-3 gap-3">
							<!-- TOGGLE LIGHT ON / OFF -->
							<button
								id="btn-toggle-light"
								type="button"
								class="flex items-center justify-center gap-2 p-3.5 rounded-xl bg-blue-600 hover:bg-blue-500 active:scale-98 text-white font-mono font-bold text-sm shadow-[0_0_20px_rgba(37,99,235,0.4)] transition border border-blue-400/50"
							>
								<span id="light-toggle-icon">💡</span>
								<span id="light-toggle-text" class="lang-zh">蓝光关闭 LIGHT OFF</span>
								<span id="light-toggle-text-en" class="lang-en hidden">LIGHT OFF</span>
							</button>

							<!-- STROBE MODE BUTTON -->
							<button
								id="btn-strobe-mode"
								type="button"
								class="flex items-center justify-center gap-2 p-3.5 rounded-xl bg-zinc-900 hover:bg-zinc-800 active:scale-98 text-amber-300 border border-amber-500/50 font-mono font-bold text-xs shadow-md transition"
							>
								<span>⚡</span>
								<span class="lang-zh">频闪模式 (10 Hz Strobe)</span>
								<span class="lang-en">Strobe Mode (10 Hz)</span>
							</button>

							<!-- RESET NETWORK BUTTON -->
							<button
								id="btn-reset-lab"
								type="button"
								class="flex items-center justify-center gap-2 p-3.5 rounded-xl bg-zinc-900 hover:bg-zinc-800 active:scale-98 text-zinc-300 border border-zinc-700 font-mono text-xs transition"
							>
								<span>↺</span>
								<span class="lang-zh">重置神经元网络</span>
								<span class="lang-en">Reset Network</span>
							</button>
						</div>

						<!-- QUICK INSIGHT CALLOUT -->
						<div class="p-3.5 rounded-xl bg-blue-950/40 border border-blue-800/40 text-xs font-mono text-zinc-300 flex items-start gap-2.5">
							<span class="text-blue-400 text-sm mt-0.5">ℹ️</span>
							<div>
								<span class="text-blue-300 font-semibold">
									<span class="lang-zh">光生物物理法则：</span>
									<span class="lang-en">Photobiophysical Principle:</span>
								</span>
								<span class="lang-zh">
									每个 ChR2 通道由发色团全反式视黄醛（retinal）捕获一个 ~470 nm 光子，触发视黄醛异构化并机械性敞开孔道。Na⁺ 顺电化学梯度内流瞬间使膜去极化，在 1.5–2.5 毫秒内爆发动作电位，实现电刺激与药理学无法企及的极高时空特异性。
								</span>
								<span class="lang-en">
